t for Democrats, incumbency, and the money advantage. Auringer has struggled with negative local coverage, including questions about her residency. The main uncertainty is the age and sponsorship of the lone poll, so uncertainty remains somewhat elevated despite the lopsided picture.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.983, "margin": 17.1}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9842, "margin": 15.0}]}